integrationChange:
输入契约：views 是必须参与验证的视图ID；fixed 的键是稳定固定锚ID，lamp_id 必须属于其中。每条观测为 [预测u,预测v,实测u,实测v,confidence,occluded]；像素必须来自相同的1024×768注册坐标系，不可混用裁剪局部坐标。objects 的键是稳定树根ID；root/crown 观测追加 [J00,J01,J10,J11]，J 是当前相机下投影像素对 Blender 世界水平位移(dx,dy)，单位 px/m。support 是实测或经场景接触几何确认的地面接触点，不是任意对象原点；ground_z_m 是实际地面高度，不是由照片估计的新平面。support_denominator 是本次预先登记的树根观测置信度总量，不能在遮挡后重新缩小。缺失/遮挡观测用 null 或 occluded=1，不得填成零残差。

唯一接入位置：refit_capture_trees.py 中现有 scene['capture17_three_crown_fit']=... 之后、bpy.context.view_layer.update();bpy.context.preferences... 之前插入以下代码。输入 NPZ 必须新增 registration JSON 字段；缺字段即中止，不默认生成观测。集成专用的 collision_members 是经核对的稳定根ID→胶囊对象名列表，必须覆盖场景全部胶囊且不重复；ground_object 是实际地面对象名。它们不是数值模块使用的测量，也不能从对象名字猜测。所有变换先快照，再按父子顺序赋值，避免重复移动子对象。

```python
from registration_residuals import register_scene
from mathutils import Vector
registration = json.loads(str(grids['registration']))
registration_result = register_scene(registration)
if not registration_result['accepted']:
    raise ValueError(json.dumps(registration_result, ensure_ascii=False))
if set(registration_result['objects']) != set(fit['trees']):
    raise ValueError('Registration roots must match the fitted tree roots')
members = registration['collision_members']
flat = [n for names in members.values() for n in names]
capsules = {o.name for o in scene.objects if o.get('shape') == 'capsule'}
if len(flat) != len(set(flat)) or set(flat) != capsules:
    raise ValueError('Missing or duplicated collision-root membership')
guards = set(registration['fixed']) | {registration['ground_object']}
anchor_tf = {n: bpy.data.objects[n].matrix_world.copy() for n in guards}
moves = {}
for tree, report in registration_result['objects'].items():
    tr = bpy.data.objects[tree]
    subtree = {tr.name} | {o.name for o in tr.children_recursive}
    if guards & subtree or (set(fit['trees']) - {tree}) & subtree:
        raise ValueError('Moved root contains a fixed anchor or another root')
    for name in {tree} | (set(members[tree]) - subtree):
        if name in moves:
            raise ValueError('A transform would be moved twice')
        moves[name] = Vector(report['delta_blender_m'])
old = {n: bpy.data.objects[n].matrix_world.copy() for n in moves}
def depth(name):
    ob = bpy.data.objects[name]; count = 0
    while ob.parent is not None:
        count += 1; ob = ob.parent
    return count
for name in sorted(moves, key=depth):
    tf = old[name].copy(); tf.translation += moves[name]
    bpy.data.objects[name].matrix_world = tf
bpy.context.view_layer.update()
for name, tf in anchor_tf.items():
    if not np.allclose(np.array(bpy.data.objects[name].matrix_world),
                       np.array(tf), atol=1e-9, rtol=0):
        raise ValueError('Fixed anchor or physical ground moved')
scene['registration_residual_report'] = json.dumps(registration_result)
```

共享 common_px 只用于每视图图像配准诊断，不作为场景整体位移，也不直接当作相机三维位姿。此补丁修正保存的原生候选及其胶囊变换；现有脚本尾部 raw 是选择性导出，不能被当作完整树体更新。父集成必须从该候选全量重导出渲染资产，并重新运行 collision_world.py 生成全部 XML 碰撞变换，禁止混用旧树干资产或旧 XML。

